<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">serpent's edge</ansi> (enchantment)

<ansi fg="white-bold">Serpent's Edge</ansi> is a Chrysalis enchantment that infuses a
weapon with living serpentine energy, increasing its damage
output at the cost of the wielder's vitality.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Effects ━━━</ansi>

  Reserves a portion of your <ansi fg="red">health</ansi> pool.
  Grants a <ansi fg="green">damage multiplier</ansi> bonus that grows with each tier.
  Applied to: <ansi fg="itemname">weapons</ansi>.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Tiers ━━━</ansi>

  As you use the enchanted weapon, it evolves through five tiers.
  Each tier reserves more health but deals significantly more
  damage. At higher tiers the weapon takes on a life of its own,
  growing scales, fangs, and eventually hardening into living
  chitin.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       enchanting (minimum 8)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     enchanting circle
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> chrysalis setting, mutation catalyst,
               binding paste

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help enchanting</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help craft</ansi>
